00:00:00,658 --> 00:00:01,698
- Oh, great.
- Great.

2
00:00:01,867 --> 00:00:03,577
(Leonard:)- Great.
- Great.

3
00:00:05,371 --> 00:00:06,751
(Leonard:)Well, bye.

4
00:00:06,914 --> 00:00:08,874
(Leonard:)- Bye.
- Bye.

5
00:00:11,502 --> 00:00:13,252
(Leonard:)Should we have invited her for lunch?

6
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:16,460
No. We're gonna start season two
of Battlestar Galactica.

7
00:00:17,132 --> 00:00:19,262
(Leonard:)We already watched
the season two DVDs.

8
00:00:19,426 --> 00:00:21,056
(Sheldon:)Not with commentary.

9
00:00:23,138 --> 00:00:24,848
I think we should be good neighbors.

10
00:00:25,015 --> 00:00:26,845
(Leonard:)Invite her over, make her feel welcome.

11
00:00:27,476 --> 00:00:30,686
We never invited Louie/Louise over.

12
00:00:31,188 --> 00:00:33,148
Well, and that was wrong of us.

13
00:00:33,315 --> 00:00:34,645
(Leonard:)We need to widen our circle.

14
00:00:34,817 --> 00:00:37,857
(Sheldon:)I have a very wide circle.

15
00:00:38,028 --> 00:00:41,118
(Sheldon:)I have 212 friends on MySpace.

16
00:00:41,949 --> 00:00:44,489
(Leonard:)Yes, and you've never met one of them.

17
00:00:44,868 --> 00:00:46,448
(Sheldon:)That's the beauty of it.

18
00:00:48,747 --> 00:00:50,707
I'm gonna invite her over.

19
00:00:50,874 --> 00:00:53,584
(Leonard:)We'll have a nice meal and chat.

20
00:00:53,752 --> 00:00:57,132
(Sheldon:)Chat? We don't chat,
at least not off-line.

21
00:00:58,716 --> 00:01:00,026
(Leonard:)Well, it's not difficult.

